'''Reindeer Terun''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] Gacha Event. She is the Christmas variant of [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Terun]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 687
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Reindeer Terun
|name2 = Reindeer Terun, type ζ
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Reindeer Terun, type ζ''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Reindeer Terun plays a different role than her ordinary variant. Instead of slowing Red and Aliens, she knocks back Dark and Alien enemies. Knocking back Aliens could prevent your backliners from getting damaged and/or allowing enemies to enter their blindspot. But knocking back an enemy could cause [[Classification|Nukers]] to miss and could be a fatal mistake, and knocking back Dark enemies doesn't make much use, as they (usually) have a lot of knockbacks, like [[Bun Bun Black]] or [[Gory Dark]]. Her decent stats against Alien and Dark have good potential in the early game and definitely make her stronger than her regular variant, but she will be outclassed as you progress.

Do note that she is simply not good against [[Le'Grim]] who outranges her or [[Super Hyppoh]] which both already has a large amount of knockbacks and additionally comes with support that completely invalidate Reindeer Terun. This means her [[Colossus Slayer]] ability is pretty much useless.

