==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], [[First-Love Myrcia (Uber Rare Cat)|First-Love Myrcia]], [[Night Beach Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Night Beach Lilin]], Reindeer Terun, [[Music Fest Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Music Fest Thundia]], and [[Seaside Pegasa (Uber Rare Cat)|Seaside Pegasa]]'s Evolved Forms were missing the ", type" part of their names that other Galaxy Gals had.
*The floating presents in Reindeer Terun, type ζ's design were reused for several things, including [[Santa Claws at Work!]]'s Event Banner, and [[Capsule Clearance (Gacha Event)|Capsule Clearance]]'s Gacha Button and Gacha Banner.
**Despite the asset being used for Capsule Clearance, she could not be obtained from said Gacha Event.

